# Activity search / filters toolbar

**Component:** `app-activity-toolbar-panel` (`admin/src/app/ui/activity/activity-toolbar-panel.component.ts`)

**Shell:** `app-activity-section` (`activity-section.component.ts`) wraps **`variant="full"`** around `app-activity-timeline` for **Activity → All activity** and for organization, person, pipeline card, and client Activity panels — one chrome everywhere.

- **`variant="full"`** — `ToolbarSearchField` + sliders toggle + collapsible filters (Logged by, From, To, Type, Include people’s when scoped to an organization). Project the **timeline** as content (`ng-content`).
- **`variant="record"`** — Compact row (type + search + optional Include people). Kept for reuse; record pages use **`variant="full"`** via `app-activity-section` instead.

**Shared options:** `ACTIVITY_TOOLBAR_TYPE_FILTER_OPTIONS` (same labels/icons as Activity).

**Do not** duplicate this toolbar on Activity or record pages; extend `app-activity-toolbar-panel` or `app-activity-section` if another row is needed.
